  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Heirloom Seeds Collection and Distribution Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">We will collect heirloom vegetable and tree seeds, reproduce them in our farm and then distribute them to individual farmers and local interest groups. The request of many farmers is to grow crops using their own seeds that they are able to use over and over again and this could not be done by using hybrid seeds. Besides, hybrid seeds are expensive and could not be re-used as they will not produce good, quality crops anymore.</narrative>
  </description>
